      "vibe": "pointed",
      "topic": "ai",
      "title": "Architect is a mindset companies keep mistaking for a title",
      "caption": "Sharp one from a dev thread: stakeholders equate 'architect' with tenure — a false ledger. Years served isn't systems judgment. The best architectural calls I've seen came from people three levels below whoever had the title on the org chart.",
      "format": "quote",
      "bestPlatform": "mastodon",
      "triggers": [
