      "title": "Putting an LLM in your inventory system is a category error",
      "caption": "A dev watching an LLM get bolted onto an inventory system: it concatenates likely tokens, it makes things up. An 'it's usually right' component in a system that needs to be exactly right isn't an upgrade, it's a liability with good PR.",
